#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:109 169d7b70fd6c470db3c8451397441c4a
msgid "GPS Dependency"
msgstr "GPS 依赖性"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:111 9a7084ed790749aba0ee089467f20c30
msgid ""
"Flight modes that use positioning data require valid position identification"
" prior to takeoff. When using GPS, to verify if your autopilot has acquired "
"GPS lock, connect to a ground station or consult your autopilot's hardware "
"overview page to see the LED indication for GPS lock."
msgstr ""
"使用位置数据的飞行模式要求起飞前已获取有效位置信息。使用 GPS 时，可通过连接地面站、或查看飞控硬件概览页中对应的 GPS 定位 LED "
"指示来确认是否完成 GPS 定位锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:115 089d88bf3e484626b7764470814999eb
msgid ""
"Below is a summary of position identification dependency for Copter flight "
"modes. Most often this position information is obtained via a GPS, but other"
" position sensors, such as 3D cameras or beacons, may be used and would need"
" to provide a valid location, for those modes requiring it, prior to arming."
msgstr ""
"以下汇总了 Copter 各飞行模式对位置信息的依赖情况。位置信息通常来源于 GPS，但 3D "
"相机、信标等其他位置传感器也可使用——对于需要位置信息的模式，必须在解锁前提供有效位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:118 203b7653870947aaaceefbf59a14cc10
msgid "Requires valid position prior to takeoff:"
msgstr "起飞前需要有效位置信息的模式："

